{"steam_appid":2059170,"steam_name":"Quasimorph","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2059170/1496274446/74808435b92411f7babb037858299fb3a4f46912/1785455460/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785513811","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257388794/a32b357baa082b0c0403b966d927f4bcb3c80774/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785513811","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/ss_d77952a24e517255182bb7213dcc15fa2bbd0174.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787051841","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/a2f664f9fa891c64b55499f20ea8e768b56798e0/ss_a2f664f9fa891c64b55499f20ea8e768b56798e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787051841","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/9abcda4de0461f02ad14879db59e75480b02ad85/ss_9abcda4de0461f02ad14879db59e75480b02ad85.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787051841","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/7777bd8e0c21b7f64e2b7fa2375e46f0d2d762d3/ss_7777bd8e0c21b7f64e2b7fa2375e46f0d2d762d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787051841","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/2853756f3fcdb602c8a7a60451016e9833ad02d2/ss_2853756f3fcdb602c8a7a60451016e9833ad02d2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787051841"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quasimorph is a unique high-stakes roguelike that blends cyberpunk, cosmic body horror, and PMCs trying to profit from the Apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/12f97b110c2624e0ef7111857b928690.poster.avif?t=1787051841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/12f97b110c2624e0ef7111857b928690.webm?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/12f97b110c2624e0ef7111857b928690.mp4?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete corporate contracts, and you keep everything you managed to extract, making your PMC stronger with every successful mission.<br>Die, and you lose everything you brought with you. <br>But you can always print a new mercenary and try the contract again. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the Boss of a Space PMC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contracts from powerful corporations.<br>Earn reputation through sweat and blood.<br> <br>Turn your mercenaries into augmented weapons with cybernetic implants and body modifications.<br>Explore planetary bases, secret laboratories, and the wreckage of starships. <br>Recover new technologies and resources to upgrade your flagship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/21fd4a75daece0f3b96ad1cc2a1ef870.poster.avif?t=1787051841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/21fd4a75daece0f3b96ad1cc2a1ef870.webm?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/21fd4a75daece0f3b96ad1cc2a1ef870.mp4?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the distant future, space has been privatized.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporations are stretching their claws far beyond the Solar System.<br>And something terrible is drawing near. <br>Discover what unforgivable things humanity has done in the depths of space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/e7ce5a201f2c623ca780723c2737eaf7.poster.avif?t=1787051841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/e7ce5a201f2c623ca780723c2737eaf7.webm?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/e7ce5a201f2c623ca780723c2737eaf7.mp4?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No one cares about the fate of a clone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Didn’t make it? Rethink your approach.<br>There’s huge room for experimentation: hundreds of weapons and armor pieces, unique gadgets, a deep augmentation and body modification system, dozens of classes, and unique mercenaries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/60b1e008943190a3ca89856737793dcd.poster.avif?t=1787051841\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/60b1e008943190a3ca89856737793dcd.webm?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059170/extras/60b1e008943190a3ca89856737793dcd.mp4?t=1787051841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt or Die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporations hire ruthless mercenaries to carry out their shadow operations.<br>Demons twist human nature and corrupt the course of human evolution. <br>Assemble a team of professionals, count your bullets, maintain your gear, and prepare yourself for every grotesque turn of this bloody slaughter.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / AMD Radeon R9 280X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Magnum Scriptum"],"publishers":["HypeTrain Digital"],"release_date":"Jul 31, 2026"}